></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#ff7024;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%">Ajay Singh</span></td><td colspan="2" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">100,872&#160;</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td colspan="2" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">5,913,133&#160;</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#ff7024;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Patrick Finn</span></td><td colspan="2" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;&#160;</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td colspan="2" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;&#160;</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #ff7024;border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#ff7024;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Kevan Krysler</span></td><td colspan="2" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #ff7024;border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">100,763&#160;</span></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #ff7024;border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td colspan="2" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #ff7024;border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">6,190,727&#160;</span></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #ff7024;border-top:0.5pt solid #949292;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr></table></div><div style="margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:4pt;padding-left:14.4pt;text-indent:-14.4pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(1)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.64pt">The value realized on vesting is calculated by multiplying the number of shares vesting by the closing market price of our common stock on the vesting date.</span></div><div id="ia7b1a55685b4481cafaa9db9826043f4_79"></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:15pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Rg',sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NONQUALIFIED DEFERRED COMPENSATION</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%">The following table shows executive contributions, earnings and account balances at the end of fiscal 2026 for each named executive officer participating in Everpure's Deferred Compensation Plan.</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:5.85pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%;position:relative;top:-3.15pt;vertical-align:baseline">(1)</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:19.887%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:14.640%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:14.640%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:14.640%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:14.949%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:14.644%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Rg',sans-serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Name</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Rg',sans-serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Executive</span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Rg',sans-serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Contributions in </span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Rg',sans-serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Last FY ($)