:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2026 PROXY STATEMENT</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#fe5000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">57</span></div></td></tr></table></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:54pt;width:100%"><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt"><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%;text-decoration:underline" href="#ia7b1a55685b4481cafaa9db9826043f4_19">Table of Contents</a></span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%">EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION</span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:4pt;padding-left:14.4pt;text-indent:-14.4pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(2)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Proxima Nova Lt',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.64pt">Reflects a cash payment (i) to Mr. Giancarlo equal to 12 months of his then-current base salary and 18 months of company-paid health insurance&#160;coverage, and (ii) to each of the other executive officers equal to six months of their then-current base salary and six months of company-paid health insurance&#160;coverage.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:15pt"><span style="color:#949292;font-family:'Proxima Nova Rg',sans-serif;font-size:15pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">POTENTIAL PAYMENTS UPON TERM